            <ArticleTitle>[Management of the chronic graft versus host disease: Guidelines from the Francophone society of bone marrow transplantation and cellular therapies (SFGM-TC)].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>S145-S168</MedlinePgn>
