            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The Francophone society of bone marrow transplantation and cellular therapy (SFGM-TC) organized the 7th allogeneic hematopoietic stem cell transplantation clinical practices harmonization workshop series in September 2016 in Lille, France. The objective of our workshop is to discuss chronic graft versus host disease and to provide recommendations for the indications and treatment of this condition.</AbstractText>
